<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Trap on Minghan的博客</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/tags/trap/</link><description>Recent content in Trap on Minghan的博客</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 10:27:29 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Jiangmmh.github.io/tags/trap/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MIT6.1810: Lab4 Trap</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-lab4-trap/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 10:27:29 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-lab4-trap/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="一risc-v-assemblyeasy">一、&lt;strong>RISC-V assembly (easy)&lt;/strong>&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>先来看一下 user/call.asm：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-c" data-lang="c">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="cp">#include&lt;/span> &lt;span class="cpf">&amp;#34;kernel/param.h&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cp">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="cp">#include&lt;/span> &lt;span class="cpf">&amp;#34;kernel/types.h&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cp">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="cp">#include&lt;/span> &lt;span class="cpf">&amp;#34;kernel/stat.h&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cp">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="cp">#include&lt;/span> &lt;span class="cpf">&amp;#34;user/user.h&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cp">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="cp">&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nf">g&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">x&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">x&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nf">f&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">x&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">g&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">x&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nf">main&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">printf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;%d %d&lt;/span>&lt;span class="se">\n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">f&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">8&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">13&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">exit&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>Q1: 哪些寄存器存储着函数的参数？例如，在 main 函数调用printf时，哪个寄存器保存着参数 13 ？&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>根据RISC-V的Calling Convention，参数依次存放在a0, a1和a2中。&lt;/p>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>Q2: main 函数的汇编代码中，函数f 的调用在哪里 ？函数g的调用在哪里？（提示：编译器可能会内联函数。）&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>下面是call.c对应的汇编代码，可以看到其中并没有调用函数f和函数g，因为对这两个函数的调用都被编译器内联了。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-nasm" data-lang="nasm">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nf">void&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nf">main&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">void&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="err">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="err">24:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">1141&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">addi&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">sp&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">sp&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">16&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="err">26:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">e406&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">sd&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">ra&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">8&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">sp&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="err">28:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">e022&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">sd&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">s0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">sp&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="err">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nl">a:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">0800&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">addi&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">s0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">sp&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">16&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">printf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;%d %d\n&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">f&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">8&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">13&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="c1">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="err">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nl">c:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">4635&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">li&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">a2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">13&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="err">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nl">e:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">45&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">b1&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">li&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">a1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">12&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="err">30:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">00001517&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">auipc&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">a0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mh">0x1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="err">34:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">8&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">c050513&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">addi&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">a0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">a0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1856&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">#&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">8&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">f0&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">malloc&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mh">0xf2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="err">38:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">70&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">e000ef&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">jal&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">746&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">printf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">exit&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="c1">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="err">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nl">c:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">4501&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">li&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">a0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="err">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nl">e:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">ba000ef&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">jal&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">f8&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">exit&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>Q3：printf 函数位于哪个地址？&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>printf位于地址0x746处。&lt;/p>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>Q4：main 函数中printf函数调用jarl 之后， 寄存器ra的值是多少？&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>